<title>USA: Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Q1 sales up 33.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Q1 sales up 33.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, N.J. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc said Thursday first quarter sales, in the 13 weeks ended May 31, were about $213.7 million compared with $159.7 million in the corresponding quarter last year, an increase of 33.8 percent.</p>
<p>It said comparable store sales for the fiscal first quarter increased by approximately 6.8 percent.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
